==English==

==={{acronym-old|en}}===
'''FYROM'''

# The [[former Yugoslav Republic of Macedonia]]

====Usage notes====

Although the word "former" is intentionally not capitalized, as it is a "provisional designator", not the title for the state, the acronym "FYROM" is often used. Macedonians consider it offensive. It is invented by the Greek propaganda, and deliberately it has put the word "of" inside acronym which is unusual, and also skipped "the" which is not consistent (if you put small words, why don't you but them all?)

